                  "description": {
                    "value": "You send powerful sound waves through an opponent's body, vibrating its bones and internal organs painfully.\n\nThe creature takes 8d6 sonic damage and must attempt a Fortitude save.\n\nCritical Success: The target is unaffected.\nSuccess: The target takes half damage.\nFailure: The target takes full damage, is sickened 1, and is deafened for 1 round.\nCritical Failure: The target takes double damage, is sickened 2, and is deafened for 1 minute."
